Cell["\<\
The fixed engine uses exact modular differential equations and finite seeds. \
Progress is printed every 20 models. Do not edit the remaining code or any \
paths. After completion open VVMF_Results.nb; it needs only the generated \
data file.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"762d3372-05a1-47b8-b807-05f38513d929"]
}, Open  ]]
